     "texto": [
      "Yes/no question = **verb first**: Synger du?\n\n- Normal question → **ja** / **nej**\n- Question with **ikke** or **aldrig** → **jo** / **nej**\n\n«Taler du ikke dansk?» → **Jo!** (Yes, I do!). In English you'd also answer a negative question with «Yes, I do!»."
     ],
